/// M30 HISTORY-044 "Smoke repeatable: run shape".
/// Source: tests/baseline/baseline_test.go symbol
/// TestHarnessSmokeRepeatable (L231-268): exec (L237);
/// dir (L238); env (L239); binds (L241-242); run
/// (L243); failures fragment plus matcher (L246); nil
/// guard (L247); assign (L250); cleanup (L251); steps
/// loop (L263); fatal call sites (L235, L244, L248,
/// L255, L258, L261, L265).
/// Disposition: replace_support (this row ports the
/// smoke-repeatable offline contract to ordinary Can
/// functions; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row,
/// variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the live run shape: the exec
/// plus dir plus env plus bind spine, the run guard,
/// the failures fragment plus matcher plus nil guard,
/// the report assign, the cleanup join, the steps loop,
/// the stream count, plus the cleanup-before-load and
/// load-before-assert orders.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): shapes pin
/// the Go statement inner bytes without leading tabs
/// (L237-243, L246-247, L250-251, L263); exec-stmt pins
/// the Command head before the quoted args (L237);
/// env-stmt pins the Env head before the quoted keep
/// (L239); regex-failures pins the failures= fragment
/// (L246); stream-count pins int (2) from the two
/// stream binds (L241-242); cleanup-before-load pins
/// true since the Cleanup join (L251) precedes the
/// loadJSON call (L253); load-before-assert pins true
/// since the load (L253) precedes the clean guard
/// (L254).
/// Facet map (launch plus diagnostics): exec-stmt pins
/// the L237 head; dir-stmt pins the L238 bind;
/// env-stmt pins the L239 head; stdout-stmt pins the
/// L241 bind; stderr-stmt pins the L242 bind; run-stmt
/// pins the L243 guard; regex-failures pins the
/// fragment (L246); match-stmt pins the matcher call
/// (L246); nil-guard pins the L247 guard; report-assign
/// pins the L250 assign; cleanup-stmt pins the L251
/// join; steps-loop pins the L263 loop; stream-count
/// pins 2 (L241-242); cleanup-before-load pins true
/// (L251, L253); load-before-assert pins true (L253,
/// L254).
/// The verdict pins live in
/// history-044-base-semantics.can; the roots-green pin
/// lives in history-044-roots-green.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; the single
/// passing path in Go order).
/// Environment: KEEP_DIR retain plus os TempDir parent
/// (row lists 1 gate; requires [] offline; binds at
/// P23).
/// Logical gates SUITE/WORK/FILES/BUILD/CHILD/PROC/CLOCK
/// bind at P23; no live run now. Accept gate P23 is
/// unmet. Timeout 120000ms is the offline default bound
/// (no Go test timeout in this row; binds at P23 like
/// the M11 no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case history/smoke-repeatable-run checks: exec-stmt,
/// dir-stmt, env-stmt, stdout-stmt, stderr-stmt,
/// run-stmt, regex-failures, match-stmt, nil-guard,
/// report-assign, cleanup-stmt, steps-loop,
/// stream-count, cleanup-before-load, load-before-assert.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later
/// integrator decision.
